  "content": "<h1><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支持我-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/加入我們的Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fquillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支持我-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在Ko-fi上支持我\"></a></h1><h1>夜視</h1><p>夜視是一個輕量級的Minecraft數據包，它賦予所有玩家<strong>無限的夜視能力</strong>，讓你在探索黑暗洞穴和建築時無需攜帶火把，完美提升遊戲體驗。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p><p><strong>強烈建議僅在單人模式下使用</strong></p><hr><h2>&nbsp;</h2><ul>\n<li>效果會無聲地套用（無旋轉粒子效果）。</li>\n<li>完全相容於<strong>Minecraft 1.20.5+</strong>。</li>\n<li>即插即用 — 無需任何設定。</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1294716/description_e7199d76-06d1-4492-aeab-06156c309240.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1294716/description_b57d75be-5f97-45fe-8598-81a6537e7099.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>",
